{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531990/extras/ad4276c2fb5b179a1405e48a2ff9354f.avif?t=1757471937\" width=616 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A long time ago, in a galaxy far, far away there exists a Galactic Empire ruled by Emperor Paipatine the 6969th. The Empire has been warring with rebels for many years, and both sides desperately desire something to boost their spirits from the fighting... And that's where our hero steps in. Squid Inkwell, a tentacalien, is itching for his opportunity to conquer another planet to expand his species's joy-bringing enterprise, and that time has finally come.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531990/extras/a4491ad64fa9ab20ce88b4721c7feb9d.avif?t=1757471937\" width=616 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Capture the people of Earth using your powers as a tentacalien, putting them to work at your operation in order to pay your dues to the Galactic Empire and take over the planet.  Also, don't forget the most important thing... placing the top brass of the world under your feeler!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531990/extras/6a00179cb6d0bddb1fd6ed4a78b6a170.avif?t=1757471937\" width=616 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531990/extras/e2e76147d0895ca4b163647f6a5e3b6d.avif?t=1757471937\" width=616 height=275 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531990/extras/c9df6773d3f4568860465e58c98f9494.avif?t=1757471937\" width=616 height=275 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531990/extras/bbe09b884ead8c9aeb29dc11df4e5413.avif?t=1757471937\" width=616 height=275 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531990/extras/3711e750ad2dfc02615f0539e2b79d71.avif?t=1757471937\" width=616 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Gotta Abduct Them All!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are plenty of people on Earth, each drawn beautifully, to capture and put to work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Visual Novel Mechanics</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you'd like to skip dialogue you've already read, or want to bring up a log of previous lines to check what you may have missed, this game has the staples of the genre.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3531990?t=1757471937","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3531990?t=1757471937","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531990/2b084e396da21bd5446a8183002e3b0e320f0872/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757471937","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531990/2b084e396da21bd5446a8183002e3b0e320f0872/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757471937","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531990/extras/ad4276c2fb5b179a1405e48a2ff9354f.avif?t=1757471937\" width=616 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A long time ago, in a galaxy far, far away there exists a Galactic Empire ruled by Emperor Paipatine the 6969th. The Empire has been warring with rebels for many years, and both sides desperately desire something to boost their spirits from the fighting... And that's where our hero steps in. Squid Inkwell, a tentacalien, is itching for his opportunity to conquer another planet to expand his species's joy-bringing enterprise, and that time has finally come.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531990/extras/a4491ad64fa9ab20ce88b4721c7feb9d.avif?t=1757471937\" width=616 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Capture the people of Earth using your powers as a tentacalien, putting them to work at your operation in order to pay your dues to the Galactic Empire and take over the planet.  Also, don't forget the most important thing... placing the top brass of the world under your feeler!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531990/extras/6a00179cb6d0bddb1fd6ed4a78b6a170.avif?t=1757471937\" width=616 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531990/extras/e2e76147d0895ca4b163647f6a5e3b6d.avif?t=1757471937\" width=616 height=275 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531990/extras/c9df6773d3f4568860465e58c98f9494.avif?t=1757471937\" width=616 height=275 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531990/extras/bbe09b884ead8c9aeb29dc11df4e5413.avif?t=1757471937\" width=616 height=275 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531990/extras/3711e750ad2dfc02615f0539e2b79d71.avif?t=1757471937\" width=616 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Gotta Abduct Them All!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are plenty of people on Earth, each drawn beautifully, to capture and put to work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Visual Novel Mechanics</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you'd like to skip dialogue you've already read, or want to bring up a log of previous lines to check what you may have missed, this game has the staples of the genre.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Acerola"],"genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531990/8b4bd78543cf7ec3b60699fc029ceaa4dd361c29/header.jpg?t=1757471937","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 Kagura Games and Acerola, All Rights Reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257195383,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257195383/movie480.mp4?t=1757471935","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257195383/movie_max.mp4?t=1757471935"},"name":"Tentacaliens: Making Ends Meet in a New World","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257195383/184d25acc37303abdbdd5d1b194663a96941b4dd/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1757471935","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257195383/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1757471935","max":"http://vid